WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:55.523 --> 00:00:57.395
(cheering)

00:00:57.395 --> 00:00:58.806
- Yes, give it to me, give it to me.

00:00:58.806 --> 00:00:59.637
Give it to me, up here.

00:00:59.637 --> 00:01:00.156
Up here.
- Up here!

00:01:00.156 --> 00:01:01.529
- Boom, boom.
- Up high, up high!

00:01:01.529 --> 00:01:02.437
Up high!
- You guys got it.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.631
- You guys got it, this is your Wednesday.

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:06.433
It's not ours, it's yours.
- Wednesday.

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:07.442
- You're going to kill it.

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:09.939
Get out there and kill this Wednesday.

00:01:09.939 --> 00:01:11.773
Have a good Wednesday, thanks.

00:01:11.773 --> 00:01:13.233
- Wednesday.

